## Mermaid Diagram Templates

### Sequence Diagram
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Frontend
    participant G as API Gateway (8080)
    participant S as Service (808x)
    participant DB as Database
    
    F->>G: POST /api/v1/...
    G->>S: Forward request
    S->>DB: Query/Save
    DB-->>S: Result
    S-->>G: Response
    G-->>F: JSON response
```

### Component Diagram
```mermaid
graph LR
    A[Frontend :3000] --> B[API Gateway :8080]
    B --> C[Service A]
    B --> D[Service B]
    C --> E[(PostgreSQL)]
    D --> F[(MongoDB)]
    C <--> G[RabbitMQ]
    D <--> G
```

